  <SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionLevelExpLabel>到達精通等級({0})所需的經驗</SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionLevelExpLabel>
    <!-- EN: Configure Allowed Ranged Stats: -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedStatsSectionTitle>調整允許作為額外加成的遠程武器屬性：</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedStatsSectionTitle>
    <!-- EN: Configure Allowed Melee Stats: -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_MeleeStatsSectionTitle>調整允許作為額外加成的近戰武器屬性：</SK_WeaponMastery_MeleeStatsSectionTitle>
    <!-- EN: Bonus Stat Value: -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionLabel>屬性加成數值：</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionLabel>
    <!-- EN: Enable Stat -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionEnableButton>啟用此項屬性</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionEnableButton>
    <!-- EN: Disable Stat -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionDisableButton>禁用此項屬性</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionDisableButton>
    <!-- EN: Warning: Only certain stat defs are applicable to weapons and pawns, the rest are just ignored. If you don't know what you're doing, I would highly recommend not editing anything in this section. -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionWarning>警告：只有某些屬性加成對武器和殖民者有效。無法生效的屬性會被自動忽略掉。由於這裡引用的是無法被翻譯的屬性代碼，如果你實在看不懂的話，就不要隨便亂動了。</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionWarning>
    <!-- EN: Note: Percentage stats use values from 0 -> 1 which maps to 0% -> 100% -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionNote>（舉例：0.35對應35%，1對應100%）</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionNote>
